@startuml sequence-view-all-reservations
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — View all reservations (UC10)

actor Admin
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Admin -> FE: Open "All reservations"
FE -> API: GET /reservations/ (JWT)
note right of API
  Admin-only endpoint —
  a non-admin gets 403
end note
API -> DB: SELECT all reservations\n(every customer, newest first)
DB --> API: reservations (with car and customer)
API --> FE: 200 OK [reservations]
FE --> Admin: See table — car, customer name & e-mail,\ndates, price, payment method, status
@enduml
